  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;denote the number of solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> is a complex number. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mfrac></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "f52HT",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HbuNx",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fzr2r",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "amk07",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
